  "notes": "Cash basis county. Governmental lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (Exhibit D, p4). Fund balance 2,855,034 -> 2,187,514; cash/investment fields left null as in FY2024/FY2025 (Balance Sheet p3 prints pooled cash 2,185,831 and designated investments 1,683, recorded in balance_sheet). Transfers 289,595 in / out (General in 69,511 from Wireless 911, out 84 to Wireless 911; Road in 200,000 from Inheritance Tax, out 20,000 to Ambulance); Component Unit 122,790 (Hospital Bond debt service paid by the hospital component unit) recorded as other_financing. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Balance Sheet (totals equal the Statement of Net Position, p1). Detail: General, Road and Inheritance Tax budget schedules (p5-8); nonmajor funds from the combining schedules (p9-11), one line per fund column (Veteran's Aid, Drug Fund, Grants Fund had no activity). Schedule 5 (p12-14) budget pages print only fund-level receipts/disbursements totals, so nonmajor detail lines have budget_final null (Wireless 911 budget-schedule actuals 30,848 / 105,381 include its transfers 84 / 69,511). General Fund Taxes 1,427,103 (budget 1,359,094) split using the General column on p4. General Assistance (budget 1,650) and Inheritance Tax Capital Outlay (budget 100,000) had no actual and are omitted. Read pages 1-14 of 14"
